        <section class="site-section community" id="community">
          <div class="section-head">
            <p class="section-kicker">Community</p>
            <h2>Follow development and contribute feedback</h2>
          </div>
          <p>
            Commonwealth Online is a working multiplayer framework: dedicated servers, remote player replication,
            appearance and equipment sync, shared world state, private Iroh hosting, public discovery and host moderation
            are all in place, and both the Anniversary Edition and the original release of Fallout 4 are supported.
            Combat, quests, NPCs, settlements, voice chat and
            large-server performance are actively in development. DLC, mods and Creation Club content are not required
            unless other players have them. Community feedback and testing interest help shape priorities as systems
            mature.
          </p>
          <div class="community__actions">
            <a class="co-btn co-btn--primary" href="#" data-co-link="nexus" aria-label="Download the Commonwealth Online mod and server software from Nexus Mods">Download mod &amp; server</a>
